title: >-
  Helios: reproducibility artifact for "Measurement and Prediction of Land
  Surface Temperature in Chennai and Bangalore, India, Using a Polyglot
  Machine Learning Pipeline and Landsat 8/9 Imagery"
message: >-
  If you use this artifact, please cite it using the metadata below, and
